。"]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[5]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[119,3]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&吕布\n哈哈，看來賢弟是落難啦。"]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&刘备\n……………"]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&吕布\n賢弟是不是不爽我接收了徐州啊？\n這是你有所不知，\n我這麼做是有理由的。"]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&吕布\n當你不在的時候，\n張飛把徐州治理得一團糟，\n所以本大爺才暫時幫你接管徐州的。"]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[3]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[33,2]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&张飞\n三姓家奴！\n你搶我們地盤不說，\n居然還敢狡辯！？"]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[3]},{"op":51,"name":"actor_face","args":[32,2,1]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&刘备\n三弟，休得胡言！"]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[3]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[33,0]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&张飞\n大哥………"]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[3]},{"op":51,"name":"actor_face","args":[32,6,3]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&刘备\n呂將軍多想了，\n我怎麼會不了解您的人格呢？"]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&刘备\n千錯萬錯都是我的三弟的錯，\n今後我一定會好好管教他的。"]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[3]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&吕布\n哈哈，你能理解就行了。"]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&吕布\n千錯萬錯都是張飛的錯，\n我不過是替天行道罷了。"]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&刘备\n……………"]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[3]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[3,2]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&关羽\n(哼！)"]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[3,0]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[3]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[32,0]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[119,0]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&吕布\n既然誤會已經釐清了，\n那麼徐州也該物歸原主了。"]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[119,17]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&吕布\n本大爺不才，哪有治理徐州的本事。"]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&吕布\n賢弟則不然。\n你名聞天下，仁德蓋世。\n何不再次接管徐州，我倆攜手抗曹呢？"]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[3]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&张辽\n……………"]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[3]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[32,6]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&刘备\n呂將軍的好意，我們心領了。\n你願意收留我們，我們已經很滿足了，\n哪敢反客為主呢。"]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&刘备\n呂將軍的人格高尚，武勇天下無雙。\n您來治理徐州是萬民之福，\n我感激您都還來不及呢。"]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[1]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[119,3]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&吕布\n哈哈，說得好！"]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[3]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[119,17]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&吕布\n你們都聽到了吧？\n不是我呂布非要霸著徐州不還，\n而是劉備自己拜託我接管徐州的喔！"]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&吕布\n既然你誠心誠意的拜託我了，\n那我就大發慈悲的接管徐州吧！\n哈哈哈哈哈哈！"]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[3]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[3,2]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[33,2]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&关羽\n(呂布！你欺人太甚────)"]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&张飞\n(三姓家奴，你給俺記著！\n俺總有一天一定會把你大卸八塊！)"]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[3]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[119,0]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&吕布\n既然如此，小沛就借給你們駐軍。\n咱哥倆不分彼此，一同對抗曹操。"]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&吕布\n你可得好好幹，別讓為兄失望喔。\n哈哈哈哈哈哈。"]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[32,0]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&刘备\n……………"]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[8]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[119,2]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&吕布\n你還在等什麼？快點跟本大爺道謝呀！\n你該不會是忘了本大爺此刻收留你們\n的恩情了吧？"]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&刘备\n……………"]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[5]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[32,6]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[3]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&刘备\n多謝呂布將軍的恩惠………"]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[119,3]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&吕布\n哈哈，不用客氣啦。\n兄弟有難，本來就該互相幫忙啊。\n哈哈哈哈哈哈！"]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[3]},{"op":51,"name":"actor_face","args":[32,0,1]},{"op":51,"name":"actor_face","args":[3,0,1]},{"op":51,"name":"actor_face","args":[33,0,1]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[119,0]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[3]},{"op":50,"name":"actor_move","args":[65535,32,0,64,55,1]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[0]},{"op":50,"name":"actor_move","args":[65535,3,0,81,52,1]},{"op":50,"name":"actor_move","args":[65535,32,0,85,55,1]},{"op":50,"name":"actor_move","args":[65535,33,0,81,58,1]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[4]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&刘备\n(呂布！天下人都說你是個無義之人，\n只有我一直相信人性本善，\n甚至還給你改過自新的機會。)"]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&刘备\n(然而，你居然是這麼回報我的，\n真是欺人太甚！)"]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&刘备\n(走著瞧吧。總有一天，\n我要讓你付出代價！)"]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[1]},{"op":50,"name":"actor_move","args":[65535,3,0,94,52,1]},{"op":50,"name":"actor_move","args":[65535,32,0,98,55,1]},{"op":50,"name":"actor_move","args":[65535,33,0,94,58,1]},{"op":49,"name":"actor_select","args":[65535,32,0,0,0,0,65535]},{"op":30,"name":"wait_frame","args":[]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[1]},{"op":50,"name":"actor_move","args":[65535,3,0,98,52,1]},{"op":50,"name":"actor_move","args":[65535,33,0,98,58,1]},{"op":49,"name":"actor_select","args":[65535,3,0,0,0,0,65535]},{"op":49,"name":"actor_select","args":[65535,33,0,0,0,0,65535]},{"op":30,"name":"wait_frame","args":[]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[10]},{"op":51,"name":"actor_face","args":[126,0,1]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&陈宫\n(看樣子劉備並沒有完全釋懷，\n他遲早會報復我們的。)"]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&陈宫\n(必須趁早把他除掉，方能高枕無憂。)"]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[10]},{"op":22,"name":"info","args":["陳宮的擔憂是正確的，劉備的心中已埋下\n報復呂布的種子，呂布也一步一步的走向\n了敗亡之路………"]},{"op":29,"name":"fade_in","args":[]},{"op":47,"name":"op_2f","args":[]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}]}]},{"index":2,"offset":3530,"sections":[{"index":0,"offset":3532,"title":"張飛盜馬","body_off":3551,"body_end":5716,"conditions":[{"op":2,"name":"comment","args":["張飛盜馬"]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}],"body":[{"op":10,"name":"clear_flags","args":[]},{"op":47,"name":"op_2f","args":[]},{"op":8,"name":"set_menu","args":[0]},{"op":36,"name":"play_sound","args":[15]},{"op":11,"name":"set_flag","args":[1832,1]},{"op":11,"name":"set_flag","args":[588,1]},{"op":56,"name":"set_attr","args":[834,15,0,216]},{"op":117,"name":"set_s_image","args":[834,98]},{"op":117,"name":"set_s_image","args":[15,115]},{"op":117,"na