興\n才對呀。"]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&刘备\n………………"]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&孙乾\n(難不成張將軍他……？)"]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[3]},{"op":48,"name":"actor_appear","args":[42,53,5,2,0]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&糜芳\n報！"]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[3]},{"op":50,"name":"actor_move","args":[65535,42,0,53,41,2]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[42,0]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&糜芳\n主公！呂布殺過來了！\n我們得快點做好作戰的準備。"]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[32,3]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&刘备\n什麼？"]},{"op":51,"name":"actor_face","args":[33,0,0]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[33,2]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&张飞\n可恨！那個三姓家奴居然又來了！"]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&张飞\n來得好，俺正想找他算帳呢！"]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&刘备\n怎麼會這麼突然呢？"]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[32,0]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&刘备\n事不宜遲，咱們快點準備迎戰吧！"]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[33,0]},{"op":51,"name":"actor_face","args":[40,0,1]},{"op":50,"name":"actor_move","args":[65535,42,0,68,34,3]},{"op":50,"name":"actor_move","args":[65535,33,0,53,41,3]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[1]},{"op":50,"name":"actor_move","args":[65535,33,0,40,50,1]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[42,0]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[33,0]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[3]},{"op":8,"name":"set_menu","args":[1]},{"op":6,"name":"battle_select_units","args":[1,2,0,1,0,0,0,65535,65535,65535,65535,65535]},{"op":6,"name":"battle_select_units","args":[1,2,65535,65535,65535,65535,65535,65535,65535,65535,65535,65535]},{"op":6,"name":"battle_select_units","args":[1,2,65535,65535,65535,65535,65535,65535,65535,65535,65535,65535]},{"op":6,"name":"battle_select_units","args":[1,2,65535,65535,65535,65535,65535,65535,65535,65535,65535,65535]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}]}]},{"index":3,"offset":5716,"sections":[{"index":0,"offset":5718,"title":"玩家切换","body_off":5739,"body_end":5907,"conditions":[{"op":2,"name":"comment","args":["玩家切换"]},